              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.20.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yn. 20.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ng'ali muboolela ndi, siosi siosi nisio mukaania khu sibala aba siakaanisiibwe mwikulu, lundi siosi siosi nisio mufukiilila khu sibala siafukiiliilwe mwikulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lundi muboolela ndi, kaaba bali babili khwinywe mufukiilisiana khu sibala khu siindu siosi siosi nisio musaba, mulakholelwa murio ne Paapa wase we mwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila niio babili namwe bataru bebuusiisie mwisina liase, aba ndi nabo abwenao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lukano lwo mukholi okhaaba ne sibeelwa tawe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.3+LUK.17.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 17.3-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio Petero echa khu Yesu aamureeba ali, “Omwami, wandaayase akholela bubwoni khenga ne mubeela? Kamakhabi saba?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu amukobosia ali, “Se khuboolela ndi khukhwola kamakhabi saba tawe, ne kakhali kamakhabi kamakhumi saba khukhwola saba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18.22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kamakhumi saba khukhwola saba:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "namwe kamakhumi saba na saba.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Bubwami bwe mwikulu bunyala khulekhasibwa no mwami owenya khumenieelesia bitabu bie chirupia bie bakholi bewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga arakikha khubala, mulala aareerwa khu niye owaba ne likobi lie chirupia chimilioni chingali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne nga nilwo akhanyala khuruunga tawe, Omwami wewe aalaka ali akusibwe, alala no mukhasi wewe ne babaana bewe nende nibio aba nabio bioosi, likobi liruungwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omukholi oyo aamukwa mu bikele ne khumwikoonjelela ali, ‘Omwami kholele siisa khakhuruunge choosi!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami amukholela siisa, amubeela likobi aamulekhuula acha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ne kakhali omukholi chana oyo, nga ne aarura enje, aanyoola mulala khu bakholi basie owaba ne likobi liewe lie chirupia emia, aamutiila enjasi ne aloma ali, ‘Nduunge likobi liase.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omukholi wasie oyo aamukwa mu bikele amwikoonjelela ali, ‘Kholele siisa, khakhuruunge choosi!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aaloba, mala aacha aamura niye mu siboe nabwila nga akharuunge likobi elio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga bakholi basie babona bario babiililwa lukali, mala bacha baboolela omwami wabwe kakakholekha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio omwami wewe aamulaanga amureeba ali, ‘Ewe omukholi omumayaanu! Khubeleele likobi liowo lioosi sikila unjikoonjelele! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne ewe nawe andi sokholeele omukholi wasio siisa nga sesi ne khukholeele?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami wewe aambwa lirima amumwaata mu cheela, nabwila aliruunga likobi liewe lioosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yesu amaliilisia ali, “Akhaba Paapa wase owe mwikulu alikholela ario buli mulala khwinywe, kaaba bali se mubeela bawandaayenywe khukhwama mu miooyo kienywe tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
